{"id": "65708", "title": "后宫好乱", "author": "千里清秋", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65708.htm", "intro": "君不见七只夫郎天上来，奔向后宫不复回。\r\n君不见，上穷碧落下黄泉，争宠之路艰且险。\r\n人生得意须尽欢，莫使香闺空对月。\r\n天生我色必有用，夫君散尽还复来。\r\n风云涌，后宫乱，七夫相争碧血流。\r\n醋海生波无限愁。", "base": "files/article/html/65/65708", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9780702.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9780703.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9780704.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9780705.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "9780706.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "9780707.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "9780708.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "9780709.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "9780710.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "9780711.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "9780712.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "9780713.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "9780714.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "9780715.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15", "file": "9780716.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16", "file": "9780717.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17", "file": "9780718.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18", "file": "9780719.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19", "file": "9780720.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20", "file": "9780721.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21", "file": "9780722.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22", "file": "9780723.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23", "file": "9780724.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24", "file": "9780725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25", "file": "9780726.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26", "file": "9780727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "27", "file": "9780728.html", "available": false}, {"title